## Why This Is Asked
New angle: data retention/backups cross-tenant exposure due to misconfig.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model
- Lifecycle/state machine
- Evidence handling and traceability
- Containment and compliance metrics
- RCA template and canary preventive action

## Code Example
```javascript
const express = require('express');
const app = express();
app.use(express.json());
app.post('/caps', (req, res) => {
  // validate and persist CAPA payload
  res.status(201).send({ok:true});
